{"id":"e1b6653dcbc23ade","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Oracle Machine","display":"df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine — Polynomial-Time Oracle Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime","aliases":["73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime","73-df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine"],"display":"df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine — Polynomial-Time Oracle Machine","depends_on":["[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime</span><span>73-df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-time-oracle-machine — Polynomial-Time Oracle Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (oracle language)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\">\\(\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\\)</span>, configuration set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OConf}_O\">\\(\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\)</span>, input <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}\">\\(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}\\)</span>, and step <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_O^B\">\\(\\to_O^B\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\">\\(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\)</span> 等均为固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 的分量，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>，不是额外自由选择的状态。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span> 及部分值记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>；代价定义在且仅在所列候选集合非空的输入上。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,m,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\\rho(0)=C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(\\rho(i)\\to_O^B\\rho(i+1))\n\\land\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\rho(m)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,m,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\\rho(0)=C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(\\rho(i)\\to_O^B\\rho(i+1))\n\\land\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\rho(m)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho\\;\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,m,\\rho)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho\\;\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,m,\\rho)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\downarrow\n\\land\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n(|w|\\geq n_0\\to\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\leq c|w|^k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\downarrow\n\\land\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n(|w|\\geq n_0\\to\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\leq c|w|^k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each oracle query and response is one transition in this model; query-string construction is charged through ordinary transitions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$O$ with $\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)$, configuration set $\\operatorname{OConf}_O$, input $C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}$, and step $\\to_O^B$ (see [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}$ 等均为固定 $O$ 的分量，见 [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]，不是额外自由选择的状态。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 及部分值记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]；代价定义在且仅在所列候选集合非空的输入上。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OConf}_O","display":false},{"tex":"C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_O^B","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pmin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,m,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{OConf}_O\n\\land\\rho(0)=C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i<m\\;(\\rho(i)\\to_O^B\\rho(i+1))\n\\land\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\,\n\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\;\n\\rho(m)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists\\rho\\;\\operatorname{ORun}_O^B(w,m,\\rho)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}time\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B(O)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{OTM}_B(O)\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\downarrow\n\\land\\exists k,c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n(|w|\\geq n_0\\to\\operatorname{otime}_O^B(w)\\leq c|w|^k)","display":true}],"bytes":2146,"backlinks":[{"id":"15e91bb15396bbe1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B$ and $L^B(O)$ (polynomial-time oracle machine and accepted language, see [[73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime]])"},{"id":"8cd0bb12bb71a086","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$；神谕程序及语言见 [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]，$\\operatorname{PolyOTM}_B$ 见 [[73-df-polynomial-oracle-runtime]]。"}],"outgoing":["ab6c7ca255afa826","773cae915e5165f3"]}